    {
      "additions": 1,
      "blob_url": "https://github.com/modelscope/ms-swift/blob/b6f1a3279c6d8b6687e0a078de587932c77c423b/docs%2Fsource%2FInstruction%2FCommand-line-parameters.md",
      "changes": 1,
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/modelscope/ms-swift/contents/docs%2Fsource%2FInstruction%2FCommand-line-parameters.md?ref=b6f1a3279c6d8b6687e0a078de587932c77c423b",
      "deletions": 0,
      "filename": "docs/source/Instruction/Command-line-parameters.md",
      "patch": "@@ -514,6 +514,7 @@ Vera使用`target_modules`、`target_regex`、`modules_to_save`三个参数，\n - packing_num_proc: packing的进程数，默认为1。需要注意的是，不同的`packing_num_proc`，最终形成的packed数据集是不同的。（该参数在流式packing时不生效）。通常不需要修改该值，packing速度远快于tokenize速度。\n - packing_strategy: packing 算法，可选为'binpack'和'sequential'，默认为'binpack'。'binpack'使用 best-fit-decreasing 装箱（会按长度重排样本）；'sequential'使用保序的贪心装箱（next-fit：仅维护一个开放 pack，放不下即 flush），按输入顺序逐条装箱，使样本顺序与每个 pack 的边界跟随顺序采样器（建议配合 packing_num_proc=1 以保证全局顺序）。\n - lazy_tokenize: 是否使用lazy_tokenize。若该参数设置为False，则在训练之前对所有的数据集样本进行tokenize（多模态模型则包括从磁盘中读取图片）。该参数默认为None，在LLM训练中默认为False，而MLLM训练默认为True，节约内存。\n+  - 对非流式的 lazy 数据集，`strict=False` 时编码失败的样本会被其他样本替代。候选顺序由 `data_seed` 和请求索引确定，不依赖之前的访问顺序；固定数据顺序、种子和编码行为时，断点恢复不会改变替代选择。同一失败索引在不同 epoch 也使用相同的候选顺序；不同失败索引仍可能选中同一替代样本。\n   - 注意：若你要进行图像的数据增强，你需要将lazy_tokenize（或streaming）设置为True，并修改Template类中的encode方法。\n - use_logits_to_keep: 通过在`forward`中根据labels传入logits_to_keep，减少无效logits的计算与存储，从而减少显存占用并加快训练速度。默认为None，进行自动选择。\n - acc_strategy: 训练和验证时计算acc的策略。可选为`seq`和`token`级别的acc，默认为`token`。",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/modelscope/ms-swift/raw/b6f1a3279c6d8b6687e0a078de587932c77c423b/docs%2Fsource%2FInstruction%2FCommand-line-parameters.md",
      "sha": "2602e9f071ec7e73587ee58d03d427b3f7918d65",
      "status": "modified"
    },
    {
      "additions": 1,
      "blob_url": "https://github.com/modelscope/ms-swift/blob/b6f1a3279c6d8b6687e0a078de587932c77c423b/docs%2Fsource_en%2FInstruction%2FCommand-line-parameters.md",
      "changes": 1,
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/modelscope/ms-swift/contents/docs%2Fsource_en%2FInstruction%2FCommand-line-parameters.md?ref=b6f1a3279c6d8b6687e0a078de587932c77c423b",
      "deletions": 0,
      "filename": "docs/source_en/Instruction/Command-line-parameters.md",
      "patch": "@@ -526,6 +526,7 @@ Training arguments include the [base arguments](#base-arguments), [Seq2SeqTraine\n - packing_num_proc: Number of processes for packing, default is 1. Note that different values of `packing_num_proc` will result in different packed datasets. (This parameter does not take effect during streaming packing). Usually there is no need to modify this value, as packing speed is much faster than tokenization speed.\n - packing_strategy: Packing algorithm, one of 'binpack' and 'sequential', default is 'binpack'. 'binpack' uses best-fit-decreasing bin packing (which reorders samples by length); 'sequential' uses order-preserving greedy packing (next-fit: a single open pack, flushed when the next sample doesn't fit), keeping samples in input order so the sample order and pack boundaries follow a sequential sampler (use `packing_num_proc=1` for a single global ordering).\n - lazy_tokenize: Whether to use lazy tokenization. If set to `False`, all dataset samples will be tokenized (and for multimodal models, images will be loaded from disk) before training begins. Default is `None`: in LLM training, it defaults to `False`; in MLLM training, it defaults to `True` to save memory.\n+  - For non-streaming lazy datasets, encoding failures use replacement samples when `strict=False`. The candidate order depends on `data_seed` and the requested index, not previous accesses. With unchanged dataset order, seed, and encoding behavior, resuming does not change replacement selection. The same failing index also uses the same candidate order across epochs; different failing indices may still select the same replacement.\n   - Note: If you want to perform image data augmentation, you need to set `lazy_tokenize` (or `streaming`) to True and modify the `encode` method in the Template class.\n - use_logits_to_keep: Pass `logits_to_keep` in the `forward` method based on labels to reduce the computation and storage of unnecessary logits, thereby reducing memory usage and accelerating training. The default is `None`, which enables automatic selection.\n - acc_strategy: Strategy for calculating accuracy during training and validation. Options are `seq`-level and `token`-level accuracy, with `token` as the default.",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/modelscope/ms-swift/raw/b6f1a3279c6d8b6687e0a078de587932c77c423b/docs%2Fsource_en%2FInstruction%2FCommand-line-parameters.md",
      "sha": "bed8ee24e8ce87c313b3fed91994e50f3cfe53d0",
      "status": "modified"
    },
    {
      "additions": 10,
      "blob_url": "https://github.com/modelscope/ms-swift/blob/b6f1a3279c6d8b6687e0a078de587932c77c423b/swift%2Fdataset%2Futils.py",
      "changes": 18,
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/modelscope/ms-swift/contents/swift%2Fdataset%2Futils.py?ref=b6f1a3279c6d8b6687e0a078de587932c77c423b",
      "deletions": 8,
      "filename": "swift/dataset/utils.py",
      "patch": "@@ -2,6 +2,7 @@\n import inspect\n import numpy as np\n import os\n+import random\n import tempfile\n from datasets import Dataset as HfDataset\n from modelscope.hub.utils.utils import get_cache_dir\n@@ -79,21 +80,22 @@ def __init__(self,\n \n         self.traceback_limit = traceback_limit\n         self._traceback_counter = 0\n-        self._idx = 0\n-        self._idx_list = self.random_state.permutation(len(self.dataset)).tolist()\n+        self._fallback_seed = int(self.random_state.randint(0, 2**30))\n \n     def __getitem__(self, idx: int) -> Dict[str, Any]:\n         if isinstance(idx, str):\n             return self.dataset[idx]\n         initial_idx = idx % len(self.dataset)\n+        fallback_indices = None\n         for i in range(self.n_try_fetch):\n             if i > 0:\n-                # The initial sample may also appear in the fallback permutation.\n-                while True:\n-                    idx = self._idx_list[self._idx]\n-                    self._idx = (self._idx + 1) % len(self.dataset)\n-                    if idx != initial_idx:\n-                        break\n+                if fallback_indices is None:\n+                    # Keep retries independent of access order, including after resume.\n+                    rng = random.Random(self._fallback_seed + int(initial_idx))\n+                    fallback_indices = iter(rng.sample(range(len(self.dataset) - 1), self.n_try_fetch - 1))\n+                idx = next(fallback_indices)\n+                # Map the sampled range onto all rows except the initial row.\n+                idx += idx >= initial_idx\n             data = self.dataset[idx]\n             try:\n                 return self.encode_func(data, return_length=True)",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/modelscope/ms-swift/raw/b6f1a3279c6d8b6687e0a078de587932c77c423b/swift%2Fdataset%2Futils.py",
      "sha": "100cd6c6606daa3c9476d8b67be142dca8ddd71f",
      "status": "modified"
    },
    {
      "additions": 24,
      "blob_url": "https://github.com/modelscope/ms-swift/blob/b6f1a3279c6d8b6687e0a078de587932c77c423b/tests%2Fgeneral%2Ftest_lazy_dataset_retries.py",
      "changes": 25,
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/modelscope/ms-swift/contents/tests%2Fgeneral%2Ftest_lazy_dataset_retries.py?ref=b6f1a3279c6d8b6687e0a078de587932c77c423b",
      "deletions": 1,
      "filename": "tests/general/test_lazy_dataset_retries.py",
      "patch": "@@ -36,7 +36,7 @@ def test_last_fallback_is_not_skipped(self):\n         self.assertEqual(len(self.attempts), 3)\n         self.assertEqual(set(self.attempts), {0, 1, 2})\n \n-    def test_retry_cursor_wraps_without_repeating_initial_row(self):\n+    def test_repeated_access_does_not_retry_initial_row(self):\n         data = self._dataset([False, True], random_state=1)\n         for _ in range(4):\n             self.attempts.clear()\n@@ -71,6 +71,29 @@ def test_dataloader_can_skip_bad_rows(self):\n         loader = DataLoader(data, batch_size=2, num_workers=0)\n         self.assertEqual(next(iter(loader))['id'].tolist(), [1, 1])\n \n+    def test_fallback_matches_after_resume(self):\n+        valid = [i not in {2, 20} for i in range(64)]\n+        continuous = self._dataset(valid, error=MaxLengthError, random_state=42)\n+        full = [continuous[i] for i in range(32)]\n+\n+        interrupted = self._dataset(valid, error=MaxLengthError, random_state=42)\n+        prefix = [interrupted[i] for i in range(16)]\n+        resumed = self._dataset(valid, error=MaxLengthError, random_state=42)\n+        tail = [resumed[i] for i in range(16, 32)]\n+\n+        self.assertEqual(full, prefix + tail)\n+\n+    def test_fallback_is_independent_of_access_order(self):\n+        valid = [i not in {2, 3, 20} for i in range(64)]\n+        for error in [ValueError, MaxLengthError]:\n+            with self.subTest(error=error.__name__):\n+                first = self._dataset(valid, error=error, random_state=42)\n+                expected = {i: first[i] for i in [2, 3, 20]}\n+                second = self._dataset(valid, error=error, random_state=42)\n+                for i in [20, 3, 2, 20, 2]:\n+                    self.assertEqual(second[i], expected[i])\n+                self.assertEqual(second[-44], expected[20])\n+\n \n if __name__ == '__main__':\n     unittest.main()",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/modelscope/ms-swift/raw/b6f1a3279c6d8b6687e0a078de587932c77c423b/tests%2Fgeneral%2Ftest_lazy_dataset_retries.py",
      "sha": "25536fe2ca4e7e0a006858802ac7b6e4d2d60199",
      "status": "modified"
    }
